License tags under module/os/netbsd follow the FreeBSD port:

  CDDL-1.0	ZFS logic derived from OpenZFS/Illumos (vnodeops, vfsops,
		abd, zvol, arc, ctldir, …) and Illumos SPL (list, callb,
		acl_common, cmn_err, string, uio).

  BSD-2-Clause	OS glue and files descended from FreeBSD SPL (kmem, kstat,
		sysctl, ioctl_os, crypto_os, kmod_core, sunddi, file_os, …).

  Sun RPC	In-module XDR (xdr.c, xdr_mem.c, xdr_array.c, rpc/xdr.h,
		rpc/types.h) copied from NetBSD common/lib/libc/rpc and
		include/rpc.  Keep that license; do not relicense from
		Linux SPL (GPL-2.0-or-later).
